    "title": "Utah County Fire Department deploys 4th crew out of state this year - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By DANIEL WOODRUFF, REPORTER/ANCHOR KSL TV ,\n23 hours ago SPANISH FORK – Another group of firefighters from Utah is in Nebraska helping crews battle ongoing wildfires. This is the fourth crew of Utah County firefighters to deploy on a mutual aid mission this year, and it’s only March. Utah’s fire season hasn’t even started yet. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
